    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d150">

                <pb facs="0297" n="213" sameAs="frus:frus1945Malta/pg213"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.01/12–144</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            President
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-12-01">December 1, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Special Information for the President</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#center">[Excerpts]<anchor n="1" xml:id="d150-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>These international developments of the past two or three days will be of
                    especial interest to you:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . . </p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">New Polish Cabinet</hi>. Schoenfeld reports that the new
                    Polish Government is generally considered to be made up of the anti-Russian wing
                    of the London Poles. The Chairman of the
                    Lublin Committee, Osobka-Morawski, in a speech reported by the Soviet press, has
                    indicated the willingness of his organization to cooperate with Mikolajczyk but only on the platform supported
                    by the Lublin Committee.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . . </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        E. R. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius,
                                Jr</hi>.
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
